# Planetarium of Wan Shi Tong, made a creature by Animate Artifact, has Cubwarden mutated over it (CR 702.140c): the merged
# permanent is Cubwarden with the Planetarium's abilities as well (CR 702.140e), and "do this only once each turn" (CR
# 603.2h) is still asked of that ability, which is the Planetarium's whichever card is on top. On turn 7 Opt's scry
# triggers it and Bot1 casts Ornithopter from the top of its library; the merged permanent's own scry 2 that turn does not
# trigger it, so nothing goes on the stack and the second Ornithopter is never offered.

